// H.A.M. MEMBERS, reported as "h.a.m members - not coded to be pickpocketed". They were missing all
// three things a target needs: op3=Pickpocket on the npc, an [opnpc3] trigger, and a row here.
//
// Level 15 and 22.2 experience are oldschool.runescape.wiki/w/H.A.M._Member's. success_chance sits
// on the ladder the rows above already describe - 1 -> 180, 10 -> 150, 25 -> 100, 32 -> 74,
// 40 -> 50 - so level 15 interpolates to 133. The four npcs are the two civilians and the two who
// walk about the hideout - the two who sit and lie there are scenery, and the cache withholds the
// Pickpocket op from them. The H.A.M. guards are fought, not robbed.
//
// THE RARITIES ARE THE WIKI'S, RESCALED. The wiki's table is out of 102 and
// ~pick_pocket_check_for_reward (skill_thieving/scripts/thieving.rs2) rolls one shared 128-slot
// table, decrementing the denominator by each entry in turn - so every numerator here is the wiki's
// multiplied by 128/102 and rounded, which keeps both the relative and the absolute rates. They sum
// come to 126, leaving 2/128 for nothing at all, which is the wiki's own 1/50 "Nothing". Rounding
// 36 entries up overshot 128 by four slots, and those four are taken off the coins entry - the most
// common one by a long way - so that every uncommon item keeps its scaled figure exactly.
//
// Four entries are dropped rather than converted: the easy clue scroll and Rocky are later
// additions, the three grimy herbs are quoted out of 561 and round to nothing at this resolution,
// and the "coin pouch" is a 2017 wrapper - a 2006 pocket pays coins, so coins is what it pays.
// Several items are named for the Dig Site in this cache, which is simply where the models came
// from: digsitebuttons is "Buttons", digsitearmour1 is "Damaged armour", digsitesword is "Rusty
// sword", leather_armour is "Leather body" and cow_hide is "Cowhide".
[pickpocket_ham_member]
table=pickpocket
data=npc,favour_male_ham_civilian
data=npc,favour_female_ham_civilian
data=level,15
data=experience,222
data=stun_ticks,8
data=stun_damage,2
data=success_chance,133,240
data=loot,coins,1,20,17
data=loot,digsitebuttons,1,1,5
data=loot,digsitearmour1,1,1,5
data=loot,digsitesword,1,1,5
data=loot,bronze_arrow,1,13,4
data=loot,bronze_axe,1,1,4
data=loot,bronze_dagger,1,1,4
data=loot,bronze_pickaxe,1,1,4
data=loot,iron_axe,1,1,4
data=loot,iron_dagger,1,1,4
data=loot,iron_pickaxe,1,1,4
